 "doctype": "Print Format",
 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<!--\n================================================================\nWHY THE HEADER OVERLAPS ON PAGE 2+\n================================================================\n\nROOT CAUSE:\nChrome Print Preview does NOT apply @page rules from <style>\ntags that are nested inside <body> elements.\n\nIn ERPNext, the print format HTML is injected via:\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"print-format-gutter\">\n      <div class=\"print-format\">\n        {{ body }}    \u2190 our <style> tag with @page lives HERE\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n\nBecause our @page { margin-top: 80px } is inside <body>\n(nested 3 levels deep inside .print-format), Chrome ignores\nit entirely. The page margin is effectively 0.\n\nOn page 1: The header div is still in normal document flow,\nso content flows below it. Looks correct.\n\nOn page 2+: The header repeats via position:fixed (top:0).\nBut because @page margin-top is ignored, content starts at\ny=0 \u2014 the same position as the header. Result: overlap.\n\nTHE PERMANENT FIX:\nA <script> tag injects the @page rule into <head> at runtime,\nwhere Chrome WILL apply it. The @page rule inside <style> is\nkept as a fallback for other browsers.\n\nHEADER HEIGHT: 80px (from inner div height:80px)\n@page margin-top: 80px (EXACT match \u2014 no guessing)\n================================================================\n-->\n\n<style>\n@page {\n    margin-top: 80px;\n    margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.footer-img img {\n    width: 100%;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.print-format {\n    padding-top: 30px !important;\n}\n\n.letter-head-footer {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n.print-format p {\n    margin: 1px 0;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.print-format td {\n    line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\nbody {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n}\n\n@media screen {\n    .print-format {\n        width: 9.4in;\n        padding: 0.20in;\n        min-height: 11.7in;\n    }\n}\n\n@media print {\n    .print-format {\n        display: block !important;\n        padding-top: 0 !important;\n        overflow: visible !important;\n    }\n\n    .page-break {\n        display: block !important;\n    }\n\n    \n\n\n\n    #footer-html {\n        position: fixed !important;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        order: initial !important;\n        z-index: 1000;\n    }\n\n    .footer-img {\n        position: fixed !important;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n        order: initial !important;\n        z-index: 1000;\n    }\n\n    .footer-img img {\n        max-height: 70px;\n        width: auto;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<!--\nPERMANENT FIX: Chrome ignores @page rules inside <body>.\nInject the @page rule into <head> at runtime.\nThis runs before window.print() is called.\n-->\n<script>\n(function(){\n    var s = document.createElement('style');\n    s.textContent = '@page{margin-top:80px;margin-bottom:80px}';\n    document.head.appendChild(s);\n})();\n</script>\n\n<!-- HEADER: 80px tall, repeats on every page via position:fixed -->\n<div id=\"header-html\">\n\n   <div style=\"position:relative; width:100%; height:80px;\">\n\n    <!-- Client Logo -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; left:0; top:0;\">\n        {% if doc.custom_client_logo %}\n            <img src=\"{{ doc.custom_client_logo or \"\" }}\"\n                 style=\"height:55px; width:auto;\">\n        \n        {% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Company Logo -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute; right:0; top:0;\">\n        {% set logo = frappe.db.get_value(\"Orion Settings\", None, \"company_logo\") %}\n        {% if logo %}\n            <img src=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url(logo) }}\"\n                 style=\"height:55px; width:auto;\">\n        {% endif %}\n    </div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n   <div style=\"margin-top:40px; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Quotation No.: {{ doc.name }}<br>\n    Date: {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.transaction_date, \"dd MMMM yyyy\") }}<br>\n    Valid Until: {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.valid_till, \"dd MMMM yyyy\") }}\n</div>\n\n{% if doc.quotation_to == \"Lead\" %}\n    {% set lead = frappe.get_doc(\"Lead\", doc.party_name) %}\n{% endif %}\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:50px; width:100%;\">\n\n    <!-- Prepared For -->\n    <div style=\"width:45%; float:left;\">\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n            Prepared For\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:1.8;\">\n\n            <b>Client Name:</b>\n            {{ lead.lead_name if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else doc.customer_name }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Contact Person:</b>\n            {{ lead.lead_name if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Designation:</b>\n            {{ lead.job_title if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Contact No.:</b>\n            {{ lead.mobile_no if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Email:</b>\n            {{ lead.email_id if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>TRN/VAT No.:</b>\n            {{ lead.custom_trn_vat_number if doc.quotation_to==\"Lead\" else \"\" }}\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Prepared By -->\n    <div style=\"width:40%; float:right;\">\n         {% set company = frappe.get_doc(\"Company\", doc.company) %}\n        {% set employee = frappe.get_doc(\"Employee\", doc.custom_prepared_by) %}\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n            Prepared By\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; line-height:1.8;\">\n\n            <b>Company Name:</b>\n            {{ doc.company }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Contact Person:</b>\n            {{ doc.custom_contact_persons }}\n            <br>\n\n            \n            <b>Designation:</b>\n            {{ doc.custom_designation or \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Contact No.:</b>\n            {{ doc.custom_contact_no or \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>Email:</b>\n            {{ doc.custom_email or \"\" }}\n            <br>\n\n            <b>TRN/VAT No.: {{ company.custom_trn_vat_number or \"\" }}</b>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SUBJECT -->\n\n<!-- SUBJECT -->\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:40px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n\n    <div style=\"\n        font-size:12px;\n        font-weight:bold;\n        margin-bottom:5px;\n    \">\n        Quotation for {{ doc.custom_quotation_for or \"\" }}\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"\n        font-size:12px;\n        font-weight:bold;\n    \">\n        Project Location:\n        {{ doc.custom_location or \"\" }}\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- INTRO -->\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n\n    <div style=\"\n        font-size:12px;\n        font-weight:bold;\n        margin-bottom:10px;\n    \">\n        Dear {{ doc.customer_name or \"Customer\" }},\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"\n        font-size:12px;\n        line-height:1.6;\n        text-align:justify;\n    \">\n        Thank you for the opportunity to provide our quotation.\n        We are pleased to submit our pricing for the supply of\n        services/products described below.\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SCOPE OF WORK -->\n\n<div style=\"\n    font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    \n    margin-top:20px;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n    display:inline-block;\n\">\n    SCOPE OF WORK / DESCRIPTION\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"\n    font-size:12px;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n\">\n    The quotation covers the following services/products:\n</div>\n\n<table style=\"\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    border-spacing:0;\n    font-size:12px;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n\">\n\n    <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background:#8ccf6f; margin:0; padding:0;\">\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                Sn. No.\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                Service Description\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Hazardous Waste Management Collection Service\"\n               or doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Solid Waste Management Collection Service\"\n               %}\n               Capacity\n               {% else %}\n                Location\n                {% endif %}\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Vehicle Rental Service\" %}\n                Quantity\n                {% else %}\n                Frequency\n                {% endif %}\n                \n            </th>\n            \n            {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Post Construction Anti Termite Treatment\" or doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Pre Contsruction Anti Termite Treatment\" %}\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                UOM\n                \n            </th>\n            {% endif %}\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n\n        {% for row in doc.items %}\n\n        <tr style=\"margin:0; padding:0;\">\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                 {{ \"%02d\"|format(loop.index) }}\n            </td>\n\n           <td style=\"\n            border:1px solid #000;\n            text-align:center !important;\n            vertical-align:middle;\n            padding:4px;\n        \">\n            {{ frappe.utils.strip_html(row.custom_item_description or row.item_name) }}\n        </td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Hazardous Waste Management Collection Service\"\n               or doc.custom_quotation_for ==\"Solid Waste Management Collection Service\"\n                %}\n              {{ row.custom_capacity or \"\" }}\n               {% else %}\n               {{ row.custom_item_location or \"\" }}\n                {% endif %}\n                \n            </td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Vehicle Rental Service\" %}\n                {{row.qty}}\n                {% else %}\n                {{row.custom_frequency or \"\"}}\n                {% endif %}\n            </td>\n            {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Post Construction Anti Termite Treatment\" or doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Pre Contsruction Anti Termite Treatment\" %}\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {{row.uom}}\n                \n            </td>\n            {% endif %}\n        </tr>\n\n        {% endfor %}\n\n    </tbody>\n\n</table>\n<div style=\"\n    margin-top:15px;\n    font-size:12px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n\">\n    Any work not specifically mentioned in this quotation shall\n    be considered outside the scope and may be subject to\n    additional charges.\n</div>\n\n<!-- COMMERCIAL OFFER -->\n\n<div style=\"\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    \n    display:inline-block;\n   \n    margin-top:15px;\n    margin-bottom:0;\n\">\n    COMMERCIAL OFFER\n</div>\n\n<table style=\"\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    border-spacing:0;\n    font-size:12px;\n    margin-top:0;\n\">\n\n    <thead>\n\n        <tr style=\"background:#8ccf6f;\">\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                width:8%;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                Sn.No.\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                width:54%;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                Service Description\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                width:12%;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                 {% if doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Hazardous Waste Management Collection Service\"\n               or  doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Solid Waste Management Collection Service\"\n                %}\n               Capacity\n               {%else%}\n                Location\n                {% endif %}\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                width:10%;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n               {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Vehicle Rental Service\" %}\n                Quantity\n                {% else %}\n                Frequency\n                {% endif %}\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                width:16%;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for!=\"Vehicle Rental Service\" %}\n                Unit Price ({{ doc.currency }})\n                {% else %}\n                Monthly<br>\n                Rate/Unit<br>\n                ({{ doc.currency }})\n                {% endif %}\n            </th>\n            {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Post Construction Anti Termite Treatment\" or doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Pre Contsruction Anti Termite Treatment\" %}\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                color:#000 !important;\n                font-weight:bold !important;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                UOM\n                \n            </th>\n            {% endif %}\n        </tr>\n\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n\n        {% for row in doc.items %}\n\n        <tr>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                {{ \"%02d\"|format(loop.index) }}\n            </td>\n\n                <td style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #000;\n                    text-align:center !important;\n                    vertical-align:middle;\n                    padding:4px;\n                \">\n                    {{ frappe.utils.strip_html(row.custom_item_description or row.item_name) }}\n                </td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                 {% if doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Hazardous Waste Management Collection Service\"\n                or doc.custom_quotation_for == \"Solid Waste Management Collection Service\"\n                %}\n                {{row.custom_capacity}}\n                {% else %}\n                {{ row.custom_item_location or \"\" }}\n                {% endif %}\n            </td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Vehicle Rental Service\" %}\n                {{row.qty or \"\"}}\n                {% else %}\n                {{row.custom_frequency or \"\"}}\n                {% endif %}\n            </td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:4px;\n            \">\n                {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Pest Control Service\" %}\n                {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.rate) }}/{{row.uom}}\n                {% else %}\n                 {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.rate) }}\n                {% endif %}\n            </td>\n            {% if doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Post Construction Anti Termite Treatment\" or doc.custom_quotation_for==\"Pre Contsruction Anti Termite Treatment\" %}\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                vertical-align:middle;\n                padding:0;\n                margin:0;\n            \">\n                {{row.uom}}\n                \n            </td>\n            {% endif %}\n        </tr>\n\n        {% endfor %}\n\n    </tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<style>\n.terms-section {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    max-height: none !important;\n}\n\n.terms-section * {\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    max-height: none !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n}\n\n.terms-section *:not(b):not(strong) {\n    color: #000 !important;\n}\n\n/* Table Borders */\n.terms-section table {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    border-collapse: collapse !important;\n    border: 1px solid #000 !important;\n}\n\n.terms-section table td,\n.terms-section table th {\n    border: 1px solid #000 !important;\n    padding: 6px !important;\n    color: #000 !important;\n}\n\n.terms-section table th {\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n/* Remove scrollbar from Quill editor output */\n.terms-section .ql-editor,\n.terms-section .fr-view {\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    max-height: none !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"terms-section\">\n    {{ doc.terms or \"\" }}\n</div>\n\n<!-- APPROVAL -->\n\n<!-- PROPOSAL APPROVAL -->\n\n<div style=\"\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin-top:20px;\n    margin-bottom:0;\n\">\n    PROPOSAL APPROVAL\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"\n    font-size:12px;\n    margin-bottom:5px;\n    line-height:1.3;\n\">\n    Should you find our proposal competitive please send back copy of the same with\n    signature and stamp and issue an official LPO accordingly.\n</div>\n\n<table style=\"\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    border-spacing:0;\n    font-size:12px;\n\">\n\n    <thead>\n\n        <tr style=\"background:#8ccf6f;\">\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                color:#000;\n                padding:8px;\n                width:22%;\n            \">\n                Company Stamp\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                color:#000;\n                padding:8px;\n                width:22%;\n            \">\n                Representative\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                color:#000;\n                padding:8px;\n                width:15%;\n            \">\n                Date\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                color:#000;\n                padding:8px;\n                width:19%;\n            \">\n                Signature\n            </th>\n\n            <th style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                text-align:center;\n                font-weight:bold;\n                color:#000;\n                padding:8px;\n                width:22%;\n            \">\n                Stamp\n            </th>\n\n        </tr>\n\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n\n        <tr>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                height:120px;\n            \"></td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                height:120px;\n            \"></td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                height:120px;\n            \"></td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                height:120px;\n            \"></td>\n\n            <td style=\"\n                border:1px solid #000;\n                height:120px;\n            \"></td>\n\n        </tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n<!-- FOOTER SECTION -->\n{% set company = frappe.get_doc(\"Company\", doc.company) %}\n{% set employee = frappe.get_doc(\"Employee\", doc.employee) %}\n{% set letter_head = frappe.get_doc(\"Letter Head\", company.default_letter_head) %}\n<div id=\"footer-html\">\n<style>\n/* PDF footer page uses .print-format > .wrapper (main page does not).\n   Reset position:fixed so the footer renders normally in wkhtmltopdf's\n   footer page instead of being pushed off-screen. */\n@media print {\n    .print-format > .wrapper .footer-img {\n        position: static !important;\n        width: 100%;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n        padding: 0 !important;\n    }\n    .print-format > .wrapper .footer-img img {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-height: 70px;\n        display: block;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n{% set footer = frappe.db.get_value(\"Quotation Type\", doc.custom_quotation_for, \"footer\") %}\n    {% if footer %}\n    <div class=\"footer-img\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center;\">\n        <img src=\"{{ footer }}\" style=\"width:100%; max-height:70px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\">\n    </div>\n    {% endif %}\n\n</div>\n",
